cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Redis Cache Strategy Benchmark: Cache-Aside vs. Framework-Managed Read-Through in Spring Boot under Concurrent Load"
abstract: >-
  A controlled benchmark dataset comparing two server-side caching strategies
  (explicit Cache-Aside and framework-managed Read-Through) in a Spring Boot
  application backed by Redis and MySQL. The dataset contains 30 independent runs
  across 2 strategies and 3 concurrency levels with 5 repetitions each, measured in
  a verified Hot Cache steady state, and comprises 11,325,558 request-level records.
